  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PHP 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi enu ana kwami nokeŋa, nafwila kuyimona, yenu muzaŋalu wami, yenu chibaaba chami, imanenu chakola mbe mudi Mwanta, enu akwetu nakeŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalembeleli Eyodiya, nalembeleli niSintiki, nami ekali nayitoŋojoka yimu mudi Mwanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi nawa nkwashi yami, twekala neyi mumpanda yimu, nami yikwashuku owu ambanda muloŋa akabakeni nanami munsaŋu yayiwahi; niKelementa nawa, niakwetu amakwawu akwakukalakala nanami, majinawu adi mumukanda wawumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaŋalalenu mudi Mwanta mafuku ejima. Nukwila cheŋi nami zaŋalalenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwekeshenu kwovwaha kwenu kudi antu ejima. Mwanta wudi hahehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mwakama chumaku; ilaŋa mulejenu Nzambi yuma yejima yimunakeŋi nakulomba, nakulembelela, nakusakilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwunda kwaNzambi kwabadika maana ejima kwakahemba nyichima yenu niyitoŋojoka yenu mudi Kristu Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkumininaku, enu ana kwetu, toŋojokenu yuma yalala yejima, yalumbwa yejima, yaloŋa yejima, yitooka yejima, yasweja kuwaha yejima, yampuhu yayiwahi yejima. Neyi kudi kashinshi kakeni, neyi kudi yahamekaŋawu, toŋojokenuŋa yumoyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuma yimwadizili, yimwatambwili, yimwatiyili, yimwamweni mudami, ilenuŋa yumoyu, niNzambi wakuwunda wukwi kala nanenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa nazaŋalali nankashi mudi Mwanta, nanochu chimunatachiki cheŋi kuntoŋa hanahiti dehi mpinji; chalala mwantoŋeluhu, ilaŋa himwamweni hakwililaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinateni nsaŋu yákubula yumaku; Muloŋa nadizi dehi kutiya kuwaha munekalila mwejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neluki kusawuka hela kwikala nayuma yayivulu. Munsaŋu jejima anleja dehi maana akwikuta hela akwikala nanzala; nadizi kwikala nayuma yayivulu hela kuyibula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natweshi kwila yuma yejima mudi Kristu wankoleshaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, muneli chachiwahi chimunankwashi mulukadi lwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinafumini kuMasidoniya, hatachikili nsaŋu yayiwahi, enu akwaFwilipi mweluka nawa nenu hikwadiŋi chipompelu chikwawu chatiyaŋeni nanami munsaŋu yakuhana nakutambulaku, Chiŋa yenu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hela chinadiŋi muTesalonika, mwatemesheli nakunkwasha hinabulili, hikamu hohuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinashi muchima hakunyinka chumaku, ilaŋa nakeŋi nyikabu yenu yiyivulilaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nekala nayuma yejima, yanvulila dehi; natiyi dehi kuwaha chinatambuli kudi Epafwaditu yuma yimwantemesheleli, hiivumba dadiwahi, chidi neyi chimuna chakuketula, chatela kutambula, chakumutiyisha Nzambi kuwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Nzambi yami wakayinka yuma yimunabuli yejima, mwashikila mahetindi akulema ekala mudi Kristu Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulema kwikali kudi Nzambi yetu, yowu Tata, haya nyaka nanyaka. Amena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋimwishili akwakujila ejima ekala mudi Kristu Yesu. Ana kwetu inidi nawu anayimwishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakujila ejima anayimwishi, anabadiki kuyimwisha akwetala daKesari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luwi lwaMwanta Yesu Kristu lwikali naspiritu yenu hela, yimunakaankili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
